    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "1/1\nJAPAN AIR LINES",
      "JAL (Japan) Boeing 747—Japan Air Lines is\nthe world wide airline of Japan with global\ncoverage of networks. JAl's Jumbo aircraft, 747\nGarden Jet, capable of carrying 361 passengers,\nflies daily from Tokyo to Hawaii and California.\nCruising speed: 920 kph. Maximum range: 8,300km.\nPOST\n• CARD\nB * Ai } /JAPAN AIR LINES\nJAL\n015\nPUBLISHED\nBY NBC (NIPPON BEAUTY COLOUR) INC., JAPAN\nAFFIX\nSTAMP\nHERE\n#31*3 8**37x***7\n฿H3B#\u003e+\u003e*7470E# #8 *-1\u003e7747\nB$*+\u003e* *R 361%, #$8 920km ( 2 -, 210.86)\nAt HERE RE 8,300 km.\nNBC\nPrinted in Japan\n2015.166.08"
    ],
